{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returning to campus after the break, your ordinary sophomore year takes an unexpected turn after encountering a mysterious white cat. Join a curiously named coconut chicken restaurant, where sparks fly as you work alongside girls with hidden stories. Share laughter and tears with them during the school festival, then journey to Wuzhi Mountain \u2013 where will this path lead your story?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/5e7421887ce41ccba5e7390bcf59c4ce.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/5e7421887ce41ccba5e7390bcf59c4ce.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qi:</strong>A mysterious silver-haired girl with an unknown past... yet she seems particularly fond of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;My fur needs your touch, Ling.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/1cca5e150c7a593e5bf10b7ec7443bda.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/1cca5e150c7a593e5bf10b7ec7443bda.webp?t=1756901775 width=1560 height=776 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiran</strong>:A<strong> </strong>classmate from another department \u2013 impressive efficiency yet strikingly aloof.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Fulfill your duties\u2014that's what matters.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/e5b7bd47e558a78174fa4b1b248ae9cb.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/e5b7bd47e558a78174fa4b1b248ae9cb.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Xiao'er:</strong>Sunshine incarnate with terrifying cooking skills and surprisingly athletic prowess. Occasionally reveals unexpected motherly warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your daily good morning greeting, Senpai!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/3a11ad0bc6a919beeacf87d71450d25b.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/3a11ad0bc6a919beeacf87d71450d25b.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xie Siyn:</strong>Gentle and refined bookworm who never pulls rank despite being senior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Care to join me for afternoon reading?&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.About HUISHENG studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student-run galgame circle from Hainan's 211 University Japanese Culture Club. We're passionate students creating heartwarming stories \u2014 hoping our games bring you joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4.Additional Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. On AI Technology Implementation</strong><br>Selected real-world Hainan landscapes are reproduced through a hybrid process:<br><strong>Field Photography \u2192 AI Rendering \u2192 Manual Post-Processing</strong><br>This workflow authentically showcases the island's architectural and natural beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Regarding Art Style Variations</strong><br>Character sprites, CGs, and SDCGs are individually crafted by <strong>three dedicated artists</strong>. While subtle stylistic differences exist, each maintains exceptional quality. We hope you'll enjoy appreciating their distinct artistic interpretations throughout your playthrough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799110?t=1756901775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799110?t=1756901775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/39e5a5f0ed6e2cf3bd67dd28d3f7de6a538f5ca9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756901775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/39e5a5f0ed6e2cf3bd67dd28d3f7de6a538f5ca9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756901775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"All characters are adults. Includes occasional alcohol/tobacco use and mild sexual references."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returning to campus after the break, your ordinary sophomore year takes an unexpected turn after encountering a mysterious white cat. Join a curiously named coconut chicken restaurant, where sparks fly as you work alongside girls with hidden stories. Share laughter and tears with them during the school festival, then journey to Wuzhi Mountain \u2013 where will this path lead your story?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/5e7421887ce41ccba5e7390bcf59c4ce.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/5e7421887ce41ccba5e7390bcf59c4ce.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qi:</strong>A mysterious silver-haired girl with an unknown past... yet she seems particularly fond of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;My fur needs your touch, Ling.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/1cca5e150c7a593e5bf10b7ec7443bda.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/1cca5e150c7a593e5bf10b7ec7443bda.webp?t=1756901775 width=1560 height=776 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiran</strong>:A<strong> </strong>classmate from another department \u2013 impressive efficiency yet strikingly aloof.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Fulfill your duties\u2014that's what matters.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/e5b7bd47e558a78174fa4b1b248ae9cb.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/e5b7bd47e558a78174fa4b1b248ae9cb.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Xiao'er:</strong>Sunshine incarnate with terrifying cooking skills and surprisingly athletic prowess. Occasionally reveals unexpected motherly warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your daily good morning greeting, Senpai!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras/3a11ad0bc6a919beeacf87d71450d25b.avif?t=1756901775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/extras_big/3a11ad0bc6a919beeacf87d71450d25b.avif?t=1756901775 width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xie Siyn:</strong>Gentle and refined bookworm who never pulls rank despite being senior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Care to join me for afternoon reading?&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.About HUISHENG studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student-run galgame circle from Hainan's 211 University Japanese Culture Club. We're passionate students creating heartwarming stories \u2014 hoping our games bring you joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4.Additional Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. On AI Technology Implementation</strong><br>Selected real-world Hainan landscapes are reproduced through a hybrid process:<br><strong>Field Photography \u2192 AI Rendering \u2192 Manual Post-Processing</strong><br>This workflow authentically showcases the island's architectural and natural beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Regarding Art Style Variations</strong><br>Character sprites, CGs, and SDCGs are individually crafted by <strong>three dedicated artists</strong>. While subtle stylistic differences exist, each maintains exceptional quality. We hope you'll enjoy appreciating their distinct artistic interpretations throughout your playthrough.</p>","developers":["\u6d04\u58f0\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799110/20ee76f187e3cfd93c521d1aaa6814f778a0f634/header.jpg?t=1756901775","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799110/2022413827/737406d10e829f7aae4c2f862383a9a2fb1419db/175